{"id":"646599","name":"鲜虾馄饨","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/646599/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"300g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"藕","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/646599/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉切块。","img":"images/646599/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"虾去皮，切小块。","img":"images/646599/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虾仁里加1勺胡椒粉。","img":"images/646599/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入葱姜水。","img":"images/646599/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"腌制一下。","img":"images/646599/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"葱姜花椒大料。","img":"images/646599/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热水泡一下。","img":"images/646599/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"藕切丁。","img":"images/646599/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅馅机把鲜肉块打成肉馅。","img":"images/646599/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"不要太碎，20秒就好。","img":"images/646599/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"藕丁打碎。","img":"images/646599/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"也不要打的太碎。","img":"images/646599/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"肉馅里加1勺盐。","img":"images/646599/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"勺酱油。","img":"images/646599/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"勺蚝油。","img":"images/646599/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"半匙五香粉。","img":"images/646599/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"葱姜花椒水，一点一点加入，把肉馅打上劲儿。","img":"images/646599/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"虾仁控水，加入到肉馅里。","img":"images/646599/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"加入藕丁碎。","img":"images/646599/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"顺时针一直搅，把肉馅搅上劲儿。","img":"images/646599/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"馄饨皮是现成的，买的有点大，自己切了个边，大小适中。","img":"images/646599/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"折三折。","img":"images/646599/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"折上去，折下来。","img":"images/646599/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"沾一点水，两边对捏，就好了！！冻起来！","img":"images/646599/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}